  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "b1defdbc21efc1394b871201069ad63c",
    "text": "If i start a search, select a unit, then upload a document, then go back to the mapper home page, then click Begin to start a new search, then find a *different* unit, then continue to the upload screen, the document i uploaded for the initial incomplete map with the original unit is still cached there.",
